### benzodiazepines
- Xanax (alprazolam) and related benzodiazepines are prescribed for anxiety. Counterfeit "Xanax" bars are pressed with fentanyl or with designer benzodiazepines. Benzodiazepines with an opioid deepen respiratory depression, and naloxone does not reverse the benzodiazepine.
**links:** lil-peep · fentanyl · naloxone · the-music.

### keltner
Dacher Keltner (Berkeley; Greater Good Science Center; Berkeley Social Interaction Lab) studies compassion, awe and the science of happiness. Avik studied with him. Keltner calls compassion the emotion most people believe is the most important. His *Awe* (2023) defines awe as the emotion of encountering vast mysteries we don't understand. In his review with Monroy, "Awe as a Pathway to Mental and Physical Health", awe works through reduced self-focus, more prosocial relating, social integration and meaning-making. He is part of the Berkeley Center for the Science of Psychedelics (co-founded 2020 by Michael Pollan) and calls awe "one of the key ingredients of psychedelics".
**links:** psilocybin (self-transcendence) · compassion · 5-HT2A (default-mode network) · the-thesis (happiness as the measure of what a society ending this suffering would be).

